wallkeep (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add video indexing, thumbnails and dynamic wallpaper support.
  * Add favorites, wallpaper rotation, fit-with-blur compositing and
    end-4 shell effect controls.
  * Render fit-blur wallpapers losslessly on demand, without cropping or
    stretching the foreground.
  * Add local AUR packaging instructions and update dependencies.

